      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "To weave your sophisticated narrative while satisfying the filter, ground these concepts in your core research. Start by framing your work as addressing a fundamental limitation—perhaps the existing, siloed understanding of urban development. Then, introduce the complexity of your approach, suggesting how studying infrastructure requires a *multidisciplinary* lens to understand its *systemic integration* with human well-being. This approach will naturally lend itself to a discussion of how current models need a *paradigm shift* to fully grasp the *socio-technical* relationships at play.",
      "source": "target",
